      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, we should clean up the data right after `pcre2_match`, because `regex_data_free` will be called much later. See https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/selinux/libselinux/src/label_file.c;l\u003d997;drc\u003d5ab1edf09d7896ffe9840b5c9119c18a4ebe5f2e; there are many calls to `regex_match` upon a bunch of `regex` objects. If we do steps 2 \u0026 3 before 1, the heap overload won\u0027t be fixed because all of the objects will have their own heap memory.\n\nI added more comments.",
